From 711bd9a03df9264b00723576c3ace6e2a5bc5abd Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 19 Sep 2026 00:19:27 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/3] Fix countdown reveal bug; refine product page, reviews,
 mobile bag

- Fix countdown never revealing the live drop for visitors arriving after
  release: clearInterval ran before the timer variable was initialised,
  which threw on the first synchronous tick. Same latent bug fixed in
  shop-countdown.astro.
- Kit specs now side-by-side with vertical dividers, per the wireframe
- Reviews section moved above the archive teaser, with a Write a review
  button and modal (title, comment, three category ratings, recommend
  checkbox, passport code, edition-number opt-in)
- Review model gains ratingPlay/ratingBuild/ratingValue/wouldRecommend
- Bag added to the mobile bottom nav with a count badge; Shop icon
  changed to a tag so the two aren't identical

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_012WaFXB7ZStPCrgjGNusLz5
