+  // Overall score, kept as the single number used for star averages and
+  // sorting. The three category scores below are what the reviewer
+  // actually fills in on the product page (modelled on how Lego splits
+  // its reviews); `rating` is their average, stored once so listing
+  // queries don't have to compute it every time.
